WEBVTT

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:33.830
Congratulations Spring Troupe
for finishing your run!

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:39.700
And a toast by Sakuya, our lead.
Will you do the honors?

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.370
Y-You mean me?!

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:42.790
Go, lead!

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:44.910
I've never done a toast...

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.370
Just do it, Sakuya.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:47.370
Come on.

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:49.080
Just relapse!

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:51.000
Um...

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:57.410
At the beginning, I was the only troupe member,

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:01.370
and I thought I'd be happy just to be on stage.

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:06.660
But then the theater was
in danger of being shut down,

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:09.450
and everybody joined.

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:15.290
It made me want to become a better actor
and give a better performance.

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:21.370
Closing night was the best moment of my life.

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:25.660
The joy I felt then made me
want to feel that moment again...

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:27.750
...want to be there forever!

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:28.660
Yep.

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:30.040
Same here.

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:34.040
I still have a lot to learn,
but please continue to work with me!

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:36.200
Let's give even better performances!

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:37.330
Sounds good!

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.000
'Course.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.290
Now, then... Cheers!

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:43.450
Cheers!

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:52.870
It's just like the old days!

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:57.080
Next is Summer Troupe's performance,
but I want you all to support them.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.290
But of course!

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:01.080
We've got to keep going strong
for the next three performances.

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:03.870
I'll do anything for you.

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:07.040
I'm counting on you
to write the script, Tsuzuru!

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:08.370
'Kay!

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:10.790
How are we going to recruit?

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:16.290
I put ads on our flyers and scouted some people.

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:17.700
Scouted?

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:18.910
Who'd you scout?

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:21.750
You'll find out at tomorrow's audition!

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:54.410
"Mankai Company"
"New Summer Troupe Auditions"

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:59.040
"A New Season"

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:01.540
Will people show up?

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.790
How was it last time?

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:05.790
It was one-on-one!

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:08.790
He accepted me without asking any questions.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:10.950
Irresponsible.

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.120
Heya!

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.830
Hello.

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.950
You both came!

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.870
Don't tell me you scouted them?

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:25.410
I haven't agreed to join yet.
I'll decide after I hear your terms.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:28.370
I'm down! Sounds fun.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:29.750
Heya, Tsuzuroon!

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.500
You're joining just like that?!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:34.160
It's chill. I'll make more friends this way!

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:34.870
--Annoying.
--Excuse me...

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:35.750
--'Sup, guys!
--Excuse me...

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.120
--'Sup, guys!
--Yuki, you're doing the trial, too?

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:38.410
--Yuki, you're doing the trial, too?

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:43.580
Hm... I don't really have interest
in becoming an actor, though.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:49.450
You'd look best in the costumes you make.
You'd take center stage!

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:53.160
--True. Plus, there are aspects of how
an actor moves that are hard to imagine.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:55.040
--Excuse me...
--True. Plus, there are aspects of how
an actor moves that are hard to imagine.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:59.160
Why not be actor <i>and </i>costume designer?
You'll learn lots.

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:02.330
I guess I'll give it a try.

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:05.500
Yukki! Those costumes for
<i>Romeo and Julius </i>were sick!

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:08.080
The way you adapted them was freakin' awesome!

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:10.450
I'm in the same troupe as Friendly McExtrovert?

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.080
Excuse me!

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:14.870
What?

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:16.620
S-Sorry to interrupt.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.540
Oh?

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:21.160
Um, is this the audition site?

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:23.290
Sakisaka, you're auditioning?

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:25.950
Huh? Rurikawa?

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:27.200
You know each other?

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.620
Same year at school.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:31.450
I had no idea you're interested in theater.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:35.620
Y-Yeah. I thought to audition
just to try it out.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:38.200
I'll probably fail, though...

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:41.660
Everyone will pass since
we don't have enough people...

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:44.700
Let's get started and have the three of you--

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:52.500
Man, what a dump.

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:54.750
This where auditions are?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.870
You're here to audition, too?

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:59.450
Yeah. Who are you?

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:02.790
I'm Tachibana, the director and supervisor.

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:04.290
Oh?

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:06.160
And you are...

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:10.660
I've seen him on TV before!

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:14.790
Tenma Sumeragi.

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:19.250
He's a major celeb! Wow!

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:20.700
--Who's he?
--Huh?

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.200
Oh?

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:28.790
You don't recognize me?
You from the boonies or something?

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:30.580
Excuse me?!

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:32.540
Tenten!

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:33.580
Tenten?!

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.040
Gimme your autograph!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.830
I don't mind giving autographs.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:38.700
--Yay! Gimme ten for my crew!

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:40.950
--Wh-Why don't we begin the audition?
--Yay! Gimme ten for my crew!

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:41.700
--Wh-Why don't we begin the audition?
--Ten?!

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:42.700
--Wh-Why don't we begin the audition?
--Yep!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.540
Is something the matter?

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:02.950
Nah. It's nothing.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.870
We will now begin the audition.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:11.870
Will you please say your name,
age, and theater experience?

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:15.620
Yuki Rurikawa. Third year of middle school.
No theater experience.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:17.540
You're younger than me?

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:18.410
So what?

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:19.790
Gotta be polite to your elders.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.160
Say what?!

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:23.290
Right, over here! I'm next!

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:28.000
Kazunari Miyoshi. College sophomore.
Zilch theater experience!

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.160
Let's see, next is...

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:34.080
Y-Yes! Muku Sakisaka.
I'm in my third year of middle school.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.250
I don't have any theater experience.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:41.080
A bunch of amateurs? You call this an audition?

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.580
Last up is Tenma.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:45.830
What's the point?
I already introduced myself earlier.

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:50.200
Will you do it for us? We'd like to know
about your theater experience, too.

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:56.910
Tenma Sumeragi. Second year in high school.
Fifteen years of acting experience.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:59.250
No theater experience.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.950
None? Not even once?

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:03.040
I specialize in movies.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.370
Wow! Super cool!

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:08.540
Aren't your parents movie stars, too?

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.500
Yeah.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:13.910
Next, you'll all do a simple task.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:18.450
Say "good morning"
using four different emotions.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:20.950
We're doing that here?

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:23.700
Huh? Yes...

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.040
Guess it should be fine.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.120
Let's start with Yuki.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.580
Okay.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:38.620
Good morning.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.500
Good morning!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.450
Like that?

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.120
He has stage presence.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.660
Any kid could do that.

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:47.200
What?! What's wrong with you?

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:49.700
Tenma, keep your opinions to yourself.

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.700
Let's have Kazunari go next.

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:54.700
Alrighty!

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:56.080
Good morning!

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:58.830
Good. Morning.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:00.410
Good morning...

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:01.700
Yo!

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:04.120
He changed the last line.

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:05.580
Sounds good!

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:07.500
Way too lax if that was okay.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:08.450
Annoying.

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:10.200
What? You say something?

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.040
Nothing.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:13.500
Right! Next is Muku!

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.950
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:18.540
G-Good morning...

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:20.700
Was that "joy"?

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.330
S-Sorry!

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:26.370
No need to apologize. Try again with confidence.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:31.200
Good morning.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.250
Good morning...

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:35.160
Good morning.

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:38.500
S-Sorry...

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:39.500
What's wrong?

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:43.910
It's because the hack here
gave out a sigh. Seriously annoying.

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:46.700
Hey, who're you calling a hack?!

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:52.160
W-Wait! It's all because of
my worthless, hammy, crappy acting.

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:54.700
Did anyone say that?

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:58.120
Next, Tenma.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:03.750
You better show us something good
after all your bragging.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:09.000
Hurry up and...

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:33.620
Good morning.

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:39.410
Good morning.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.200
Good morning!

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:47.910
He's not just proficient.
He's on a different level.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:54.290
He's a pro with skill gained from
years of experience!

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.040
Tenten's got mad skills!

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:59.200
Real actors are something else!

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:00.830
Of course.

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:03.200
It was okay.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.250
What'd you say?!

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:06.750
All right. That was the last task.

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.750
What?! That's it?!

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:09.580
The results?

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:11.040
Everyone passed!

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.040
What?!

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:13.790
Including me?

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:17.250
Congrats on passing, guys!
Lemme add you on LIME.

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:21.080
No way! You expect me to
work with these amateurs?!

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:24.200
How arrogant can you be, hack?!

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:26.540
What about me is a hack?!

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.250
You can't read between the lines!

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.370
What the hell?!

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.250
N-No fighting, please...

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.500
Let's all get along.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:37.080
Don't they remind you of Masumi and Tsuzuru?

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:39.290
BFFs and a bickering couple.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:41.790
We'll rake it in promoting them in pairs!

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:43.700
Don't butt in!

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:48.660
That's enough.
Everyone passed and that's settled.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:52.620
Tenma, if you're unsatisfied,
you'll just have to withdraw.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.540
You're cutting me?

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:57.700
If you're unhappy with this group,
that's what you'll have to do.

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:02.410
Fine. I'll stay.

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:06.790
Say, Tenma, why did you decide to audition here?

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:11.250
I have no theater experience,

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:15.080
so I wanted to join a theater troupe
to expand my acting repertoire.

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.830
I caught their performance
when I had time to kill...

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:25.250
...and they weren't half bad.

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:28.450
You came to watch <i>Romeo and Julius</i>?! Thank you!

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:30.870
I-It's nothing.

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:36.040
All right, this is our Summer Troupe.
Let's work hard!

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:37.500
Alrighty!

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.790
Thank you for having me!

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:41.200
Sure.

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:45.450
I guess I have to.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:49.370
Th-Three months?!

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:54.450
Yeah. We'll be holding new Summer Troupe's
debut performance in three months.

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:57.950
With this group? That's impossible!

00:12:57.950 --> 00:12:59.410
Don't worry about that.

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:04.370
We all started from zero
and performed after two months.

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:05.750
Seriously?

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:10.540
Yeah, so I'll be working your tails off
these next three months.

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:11.540
No probs!

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.330
I-I'll do my best.

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:15.540
I might regret this...

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:18.580
Now, speaking of dorms...

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:21.370
Count me in! Living with Tsuzuroon!

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:22.790
Oh, man.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.750
Your being too obvious.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:26.750
For you three to dorm,

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:30.410
I'll need parental permission
since you're still in grade school.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:33.830
I've already discussed it, and they gave
the okay to stay at the dorm, too.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.040
Really?

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.120
They believe in sending
even their not-so-cute kids

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.330
out into the world early to build character.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:43.700
Aw, but you're super cute. Let's be roomies!

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:44.870
--No.
--Your aloof side is cute, too!

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:46.620
--Your aloof side is cute, too!

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:50.080
I-I'd like to stay at the dorm if possible.

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:54.700
It's fine to commute if you live close by.

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:58.080
No, I'd like to dorm here.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:02.500
I want to seriously focus on
acting together with everyone.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:07.750
Got it. I'll contact your parents later, okay?

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:08.750
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:10.540
How about you, Tenma?

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:13.250
I want to dorm. Already have permission.

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:15.080
Can I get their contact info?

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:19.080
They're filming overseas.
You won't get a hold of them.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:22.080
Sounds like Masumi's parents.

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:25.620
At least let me leave a message.

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:27.040
Fine.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:31.410
Dorms are two to a room.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:35.870
Summer Troupe will split
the three rooms on the second floor.

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:38.330
Sharing a room is unthinkable.

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:41.580
She said two to a room! Are you deaf?

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:43.000
What?!

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:46.660
Yukki rejected me. Let's be roomies, Mukkun!

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:50.080
Oh, me? Sure, if you're okay with me.

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:52.870
Yay! We're roomies now!

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:56.410
Will you two use room 202?

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:57.750
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:02.540
Does that mean the two of us left
get our own rooms?

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:06.040
Yeah. We'll discuss again if we gain members.

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:07.700
Dibs on room 203.

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:12.000
Why do you get to pick first?
I'm fine with room 201, though.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.500
Then stop complaining.

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:15.330
Just shut up.

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:19.330
I wouldn't take room 203 if I were you!

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:21.950
Manager?!

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:27.540
You see, the Mankai Company
theater troupe has urban legends.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:28.910
Urban legends?

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:33.000
Yes. Sometimes you can
hear a strange voice coming

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:35.790
out of the supposedly empty room 203...

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:37.370
...ahh!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.540
Wh--?!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:47.620
I'm too scared to step foot in there,
so I've never cleaned it.

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:50.700
--Whoa.
--Now I'm <i>really </i>scared of what's in there.

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.290
Hey, switch rooms with me.

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:55.000
What? Don't tell me you're scared?

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.790
Never said that!

00:15:56.790 --> 00:16:00.080
You're the one who said you wanted
room 203 in the first place.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:01.160
Changed my mind.

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:02.160
No, thanks.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:05.500
What? I'm older than you, you know!

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:06.500
So what?

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:07.500
Respect your elders!

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:08.700
Piss off.

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:10.450
C-Calm down.

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:12.950
Anyways, let's go check it out.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:16.750
Yeah, we might not find anything.

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:23.410
Fine. But if I hear strange voices...

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:25.830
...I'm never staying in room 203.

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:28.450
What a selfish brat.

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:44.580
Can you hear anything?

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:46.620
No, nothing--

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:48.040
Huh?

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.500
What's this?

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:57.080
...riangle...

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:02.200
D-Did...

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.870
Did you hear that?

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:07.660
A haunted room! I'm gonna
share this on Instablam!

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:10.500
Don't! What if you catch something on camera?

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.330
Look who's a scaredy-cat.

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:15.620
W-Well, it's not necessarily a ghost.

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:17.370
Then an intruder?

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:19.750
That'd be scary, too.

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:25.330
You're not opening it?

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:26.870
Hell no!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:40.290
But we can't use this room otherwise.
We've got to see what's inside.

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:43.330
Leave it to me! I'll do something about it!

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:46.040
Manager!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:50.330
Here's Masumi, your personal
24-hour security guard.

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.660
What is it?

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:55.330
We wanted to look inside the room
because strange sounds are coming from it--

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:57.540
I'll open it.

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:59.290
You stand back.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:03.910
Be careful.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.950
Hey, get off me!

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:24.830
A real ghost! Holy crap!

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:29.290
Onigiri are a wonder!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:30.660
An onigiri ghost!

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:34.290
H-Hey! Someone exorcise it fast!

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:37.790
You all want triangles?

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:40.080
Heya, what's your name?

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:43.370
Me? I'm Misumi Ikaruga.

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:48.370
A human?

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:50.120
Intruder.

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:52.790
You've got that right, but...

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:55.120
Trash?

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:58.450
That's not trash. It's my treasure.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:01.040
How long have you lived here?

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:04.620
Hm... sometime before the theater
started doing stuff?

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:06.500
Before <i>Romeo and Julius</i>?!

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.830
I never realized!

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:12.120
I got in since the window was open.

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:14.120
This is the second floor.

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:16.700
And how did he get this furniture in?

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:19.040
Anyway, he's an intruder!

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:20.950
Should I catch him?

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:23.040
Not my onigiri!

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:33.370
Whoa!

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:35.620
How can he do that?!

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:37.910
This is mine.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.410
Huh?!

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:53.290
Who're you?!

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:56.870
Sakuya, Tsuzuru! Catch him!

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:03.410
Wow!

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:05.200
Something smells good!

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:09.870
Itaru!

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:16.000
Overpowered.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:23.290
Today's dinner will be onigiri
made by yours truly!

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:24.950
Onigiri!

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:26.120
Oh!

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:30.660
Yummy!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.160
Finally caught up.

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:37.040
Who are you?

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:40.750
I'm Misumi!

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:43.910
Misumi, why were you living in our dorm?

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:46.250
Had nowhere else to go.

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:48.330
Come on, let's call the police--

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:51.160
Misumi, are you interested in theater?

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:52.120
Director?!

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:53.580
You plan to take <i>that </i>in?

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:55.330
Are you crazy?

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:56.700
No way!

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:59.080
I know about theater.

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:03.200
Want to try it out?
Then you can stay in that room.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.950
Do I get to eat onigiri?

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.250
Yeah!

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:08.040
I'll do it, then!

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:10.200
Don't blame me whatever happens.

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:12.450
I've gotta work with <i>him</i>?

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:14.750
N-Nice to meet you.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:17.370
Don't really get it, but sounds fun!

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:19.330
'Sup, Sumi!

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:22.410
Unprincipled, as usual.

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:24.580
You have five members now!

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:26.410
Summer Troupe is stormed!

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:27.830
You mean "formed"!

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:29.790
I anticipate trouble ahead, though.

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:32.330
So how are the rooms working out?

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:35.870
How about Tenma and Misumi stay in room 203?

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:40.200
Hey, can I have another onigiri?

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:43.870
To celebrate Summer Troupe. Hitsa steal!

00:21:43.870 --> 00:21:45.540
Yay!

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:48.120
Tri-tri-triangle!

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:50.790
Do you all like triangles?

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:54.250
--Hey, Rurikawa. I'll put up with
sharing your room.
--Raise your hand if you do!

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:58.160
--What? You could just not share and
not have to "put up" with anything!
--Tri-tri-triangle!

00:21:58.160 --> 00:21:58.580
--What? You could just not share and
not have to "put up" with anything!
--Triangle!

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.750
--Hey, wait!
--Triangle!

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:02.950
I'm in room 201 no matter what!

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:05.200
Don't just pick without asking, hack!

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:08.370
--What?! Stop calling me a hack!
--Stop following me!

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:09.080
--What?! Stop calling me a hack!
--I'm worried about those two,

00:22:09.080 --> 00:22:10.620
--I'm calling you a hack because you are one!
--I'm worried about those two,

00:22:10.620 --> 00:22:11.200
--I'm calling you a hack because you are one!
--but I have a feeling things might just work out.

00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:13.700
--Well, I'm gonna knock the rudeness outta you!
--but I have a feeling things might just work out.

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:14.870
--Well, I'm gonna knock the rudeness outta you!

00:22:14.870 --> 00:22:16.250
Who're you calling rude?!

00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:17.540
What?!
